 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea6b31af646native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">距世界杯不到2个月！官方：沙特主帅勒纳尔下课 希腊人多尼斯接任</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221123/637d7b9e8250a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221123/637d7b9e8250a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221123/637d7b9e8250a.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">官方消息，沙特国家队决定解雇主教练勒纳尔，决定即日生效。同时，沙特聘请希腊籍教练多尼斯为球队新帅。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea8f4b824f7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">拜仁已五连胜！德国杯决赛：拜仁vs斯图加特，5月24日凌晨2点开战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240544404903_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240544404903_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240544404903_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">德国杯半决赛，斯图加特加时赛2-1击败弗赖堡，成功突围。决赛对阵也已出炉，拜仁将于北京时间5月24日凌晨2点，在柏林奥林匹克体育场对阵斯图加特。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-23/69ea2f0c18130native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">天空体育：切尔西若无缘欧冠将损失8000万镑 可能1亿镑卖恩佐</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e7e570f07f2.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e7e570f07f2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e7e570f07f2.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">天空体育的消息，如果切尔西下赛季无法参加欧冠联赛，他们至少会损失8000万英镑。将使他们更难找到一个利润丰富的球衣胸前广告赞助商。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-23/69ea33271cbe5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">老佛爷担任主裁！伯纳乌上演网球赛，辛纳+贝林vs库尔图瓦+纳达尔</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260423/202604232257363447.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-a