 img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260423/202604232358236513.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260423/202604232358236513.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">今天，巴萨竞技在官方社媒发布公告，球队中场胡安・埃尔南德斯在训练中左膝前交叉韧带完全撕裂重伤将缺阵数月。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea42a3c6f9bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德天空独家：桑乔原则上已同意重返多特！下一步行动将取决于多特</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.84" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240004464381_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.84" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.84" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240004464381_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240004464381_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据德天空记者普莱滕伯格独家报道，桑乔已经原则上同意重返多特蒙德。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea4b4799536native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德天空：皇马与维尼修斯就新合同达成原则性协议，姆巴佩还是顶薪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" dat