gb(0, 0, 0);">《每日邮报》的利物浦跟队记者Lewis Steele消息，基耶萨预计将离开利物浦，尤文对阿利松很感兴趣。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea4d3a7b899native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">特使提议世界杯意大利换伊朗，伊朗使馆：连11名伊朗年轻球员都怕</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.84" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240103001726.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.84" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.84" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240103001726.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240103001726.jpg"> </div><p>近日，美国总统特朗普驻意大利高级特使保罗・赞波利向国际足联提议，在下一届世界杯中由意大利队取代伊朗队参赛。伊朗驻意大利罗马大使馆随即在社交媒体发文回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea59b1b3ac4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">卫报：马雷斯卡是接替瓜帅头号人选，但他与切尔西的合同尚未终结</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240527/66548b9388a7d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240527/66548b9388a7d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240527/66548b9388a7d.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据《卫报》报道，瓜迪奥拉若今夏离任曼城，马雷斯卡是头号接替人选。曼城已与这位前切尔西主帅展开积极磋商。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea5f77a8093native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：巴萨无力支付巴斯托尼高昂转会费，希望加入几名球员抵价</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b958fde3a9d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b958fde3a9d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b958fde3a9d.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据意大利记者托尼亚的消息，巴萨梦想签下国米中卫巴斯托尼，但他们没有足够的转会资金。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69ea63da4d56fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">遭吕迪格膝击！里科：难道我还要因为他没踢死我，而向他道歉吗？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604240234304649.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-r